 <h3><u>Parda e ghaib mein</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye aakhri hussain, haye aakhri hussain..(2)<br>haye aakhri hussain<br>ya hussain, shah hussain, ya hussain</p>
  <p>parda e ghaib mein zainab ke liye rota hai<br>aaj bhi ek hussain tanha hai<br>parda e ghaib mein</p>
  <p>Ghum e sajjad mein..(2)<br>dil uska aza khana hai<br>parda e ghaib mein..</p>
  <p>1. Murtajiz se kabhi sunta hai wo shabbir ka ghum<br>tegh se puchta hai madar e besheer ka ghum<br>aise tanhayi mein..(2), majlis wo bapa karta hai<br>parda e ghaib mein</p>
  <p class=>2. Khoo bhari chadar e zainab mein chupata hai unhe<br>choomta hai kabhi aankho'n se lagata hai unhe<br>baazu abbas ke ..(2), godi mein liye baitha hai<br>parda e ghaib mein</p>
  <p class=>3. Uske darbaar mein jaa'n dene ko hazir hota<br>kaash ham mein bhi koi ibn e mazahir hota<br>dil tadap jaata hai..(2), jab mujhko khayal aata hai<br>hussain tanha hai..<br>Ya hussain, ya hussain<br>parda e ghaib mein</p>
  <p class=>4. Misle shabbir wo akbar ke liye rota hai<br>khoon rote hue sughra ka wo khat padhta hai<br>uske seene mein bhi..(2), ek toota hua naiza hai<br>parda e ghaib mein</p>
  <p class=>5. Dekh kar bheedh tadap jaata hai zainab ki qasam<br>uski aankho'n se bhi bazaar mein har ek qadam<br>khoon sajjad ke..(2), zakhmo ki tarha rista hai<br>parda e ghaib mein</p>
  <p class=>6. Loriya baap ke lehje mein sunane ke liye<br>ek diya qabr e sakina pe jalane ke liye<br>shaam hoti hai to..(2), zindaan mein aajata hai<br>parda e ghaib mein</p>
  <p class=>7. Koi daulat se koi karta hai aulad se pyaar<br>nusrat e haqq ke liye koi nahi hai tayyar<br>haye afsos ke..(2), ab saara jaha'n kufa hai<br>hussain tanha hai..<br>Ya hussain, ya hussain<br>parda e ghaib mein<br></p>
  <p class=>8. Kisko awaaz de masroof hai ye saara jaha'n<br>uski tanhayi ki mehram hai ye gyara sadiya'n<br>kya takallum tumhein..(2), is dard ka andaaza hai<br>parda e ghaib mein zainab ke liye rota hai<br>aaj bhi ek hussain tanha hai<br>parda e ghaib mein</p>
